{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000004", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "村(社区)应急预案编制流程包括准备阶段、预案编写阶段、审批发布备案阶段、评估改进阶段共4个阶段。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": ["活动筹备"], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.1", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000005", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "成立由主要负责人牵头的应急预案编制工作组,并确定主要起草人员,明确工作职责和任务分工,制定工作计划。", "knowledge_type": "responsibility", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.2.1", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000006", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "编制工作组由村(社区)负责人、属地派出所承担相关工作职责的民警、志愿者等组成,可邀请具有现场处置救援或应急预案管理经验的人员、乡镇(街道)应急预案编制人员参加或指导,可联合本地区物业、企业和有关单位共同编制。", "knowledge_type": "responsibility", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": ["活动期间"], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.2.2", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000007", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "收集突发事件案例,汇总、分析本地区主要突发事件风险。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.2.3", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000008", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "收集、汇总、更新本地区重点人群清单、风险隐患点位清单,包括但不限于:\n\n- **a)** 老、弱、病、残、孕等弱势群体人员清单;\n- **b)** 主要企业、重点基础设施、建设项目、文物古建台账;\n- **c)** 道路塌陷隐患点、山洪和地质灾害隐患点、野火隐患区域、输配电通道、燃气管线、热力管线等隐患点清单;\n- **d)** 积水点、易溺水点、玻璃幕墙、危旧房屋、低洼院落、临时建筑、易折断树木、电动自行车充电设施、燃气经营与使用单位等风险点位清单。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["人群管控", "道路交通"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.2.4", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000009", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "收集、汇总、更新本地区灾害信息员清单、应急救援队伍清单、登记注册志愿者队伍清单、民兵预备役清单、本级应急避难场所清单等。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.2.5", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000010", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "明确本地区突发事件信息上报方式、预警信息接收与传播方式,包括:\n\n- **a)** 信息上报方式,包括但不限于电话、传真、互联网平台等;\n- **b)** 预警信息接收与传播方式,包括但不限于电话、短信、电子广告牌、广播、警报器、锣鼓、入户传递、卫星通信终端、新媒体、社交媒体、互联网平台等。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["信息发布", "应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.2.6", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000011", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "明确本地区应急物资装备储备方式,收集、汇总、更新应急物资装备种类、数量、空间位置等信息。储备方式包括但不限于实物储备、协议储备等。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.2.7", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000012", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "根据实际需求确定村(社区)应急预案框架,包括适用范围、应急组织体系、报告与预警、应急处置、后期处置、应急保障、预案管理,以及附件。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.3.1", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000013", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "明确风险、人员分工分组、信息报告、联防联控、预警响应、先期处置、自救互救、转移避险、可调配或支援的应急资源等内容。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.3.2", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000014", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "应急预案应与本区域风险类别、重点人群、应急资源情况和应急能力相适应,满足具体、快速、灵活的先期处置需要。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["人群管控", "应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.3.3", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000015", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "征求乡镇(街道)有关机构、村(居)民代表和区域内相关单位、物业公司、有关救援队伍等的意见建议。征求上位应急预案主责单位意见,确认村(社区)应急预案在预案体系、应急职责、响应程序等方面与上位应急预案相衔接。", "knowledge_type": "responsibility", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.3.4", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000016", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "村(社区)主要负责人组织研讨,形成征求意见采纳表,对不采纳的意见说明理由。", "knowledge_type": "responsibility", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": [], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.3.5", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000017", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "汇总应急预案文本、编制说明、征求意见采纳表等有关材料,按程序报村(社区)审批。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.4.1", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.3-2025-000018", "doc_id": "GBT46793.3-2025", "statement": "通过审批后,应急预案应通过广播,公示栏,入户宣传,以及新媒体、社交媒体和互联网平台等方式,向本村(社区)居民公布,按程序报乡镇(街道)备案。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["信息发布", "应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.3-2025@4.4.2", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
